# Google Maps Embed API key, used by src/components/MapEmbed.astro.
# Copy this file to `.env` and paste your key. Without it, the site falls
# back to the keyless Google Maps embed.
#
# Create the key in Google Cloud console:
#   1. Enable the "Maps Embed API" for your project.
#   2. Create an API key under APIs & Services > Credentials.
#   3. Restrict it: Application restriction = HTTP referrers, allowing
#      https://209restoration.com/* (and http://localhost:4321/* for dev);
#      API restriction = Maps Embed API only.
#
# The key is public (it ships in the page's iframe URL), so the referrer
# restriction above is what actually protects it.
PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
